# Project Instructions

- Use RVM for Ruby version management.
- Always follow test-driven development when applying changes: update or add tests first, confirm the expected failure, implement the change, and then refactor with the tests passing.
- Use RuboCop for linting and ensure linting passes before creating any commit.
- Ensure the complete test suite passes before creating any commit.
- Use Conventional Commits verbiage for every commit message.
